2. Early returns
Stop searching as soon as you’ve found what you’re looking for. This idea can also be applied to a series of if-statements.

find_first_red &lt;- function(hist) {

  i &lt;- 1
  res &lt;- c() 

  while (i &lt;= nrow(hist)) {
    if (hist$color[i] == "red") {
      res &lt;- c(res, i)
    }
    i &lt;- i + 1
  }
  return(max(min(res),0))
}

find_first_red(hist)

[1] 42


